  "id": "BIT-golang-2026-56853",
  "summary": "Apply ReadHeaderTimeout when doing unencrypted HTTP/2 check in net/http",
  "details": "When a server is configured to support unencrypted HTTP/2, it reads a few bytes from each new connection to see if they contain the HTTP/2 client preface. ReadHeaderTimeout is unexpectedly not being applied when doing this.",
